# Third-party clone of LaserData's local stack -- has its own git history and
# its own .env with credentials. Re-clone it, don't vendor it:
#   git clone https://github.com/laserdata/laser-stack
laser-stack/
.rocketride/

# Guild.ai agents are each their own git repo with a remote on app.guild.ai
# (`guild agent save` pushes there). Embedding them in this repo would add
# them as broken submodules. Backup copies of the prompts live in
# docs/guild-agents/ so nothing is lost if a laptop dies.
src/agents/advocate/
src/agents/mission-safety/
